        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that by keeping our product managers involved with the customers we design and develop features that customers like to use — supporting our product-led growth.",
        "start_character": 44655,
        "end_character": 44825
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue our intense design focus on the employee experience, to support our viral bottom-up business model to drive profitable growth and to nurture our one-of-a-kind company structure and culture to maintain this competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 49222,
        "end_character": 49462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed our platform to easily integrate with other business and consumer applications.",
        "start_character": 12642,
        "end_character": 12733
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As such, we prioritize our research and development above all other investments.",
        "start_character": 42326,
        "end_character": 42406
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Rather than the traditional software sales model of complex pricing, user thresholds and inconsistent fees, we designed our pricing plans to facilitate the easy adoption of our platform by the smallest mom-and-pop stores to the largest and most complex organizations.",
        "start_character": 14519,
        "end_character": 14786
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also designed our platform to be deeply integrated and connected with a broad suite of back office systems, consumer applications and banking technology infrastructures that our customers use every day.",
        "start_character": 36596,
        "end_character": 36801
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that always having the pain points of our members at the center of every technology decision and feature we develop enables us to consistently deliver an improved experience for every employee in an organization.",
        "start_character": 11733,
        "end_character": 11956
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continually review our development efforts to assess the existence and patentability of new intellectual property.",
        "start_character": 51216,
        "end_character": 51333
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We deploy large scale brand advertising to build on this platform superiority and help create market consensus that Expensify is the category leader for expense management software.",
        "start_character": 8057,
        "end_character": 8238
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We design our expense management platform and every new feature with the aim of frictionless adoption.",
        "start_character": 19091,
        "end_character": 19193
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed Expensify to be easily configured and used by every single employee within an organization, not just decision makers or managers.",
        "start_character": 6419,
        "end_character": 6560
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001476840-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001476840-26-000009-82d4e647dbf677de",
        "accession_number": "0001476840-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed Expensify to be easy to set up, integrate, configure and use from almost any device, which has enabled us to serve employees of all types and organizations of all sizes, industries and geographies.",
        "start_character": 2144,
        "end_character": 2353
